    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so the seller pays for the insurance but the buyer bears the risk once it's loaded. that seems a bit lopsided. are there any specific documents the seller needs to hand over to us so we can actually make a claim if something does happen?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
